"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s3","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"The dataset was split into 80 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s4","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s5","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"VGG-16 attains a F1 score of 85.2% at epoch 14.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s6","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"MobileNet outperforms VGG-16 by 30.9 percentage points at epoch 6 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s7","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"From epoch 2 to epoch 12, the F1 score of VGG-16 improves by a relative 79.3% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s8","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"At epoch 2, the loss of MobileNet is 2.317.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s9","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s10","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"MLP scores 17.2 points higher on Fashion-MNIST than on SVHN.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s11","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"MLP scores 26 points higher on Fashion-MNIST than on SVHN.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s12","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"Random Forest reaches 68.8% accuracy on Yelp.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_016_s13","report_id":"v3feat_016","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null}]}